; THROWAWAY — WO-0009 deliverable 1. Delete this whole directory once the
; cycles-per-second figure is recorded in a journal entry with its CI run id.
;
; The probe is an executable on the runtest alias rather than an expect test
; because its result is a wall-clock-derived number: a timing figure can never
; be promoted into a snapshot, since the build workflow's
; `git diff --cached --exit-code` step would then fail on every run forever.
; Its output goes to the CI log instead, every line prefixed COST-PROBE.
;
; (deps (universe)) disables dune's cache for this action. Without it a cache
; hit on an unchanged executable could replay a stale figure, which is worse
; than no figure at all.

(executable
 (name cyclesim_cost_probe)
 (modules cyclesim_cost_probe)
 (libraries hardcaml)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_hardcaml ppx_jane)))

(rule
 (alias runtest)
 (deps
  (universe))
 (action
  (run %{exe:cyclesim_cost_probe.exe})))
